  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Koteswar Patra@E vs State Of Odisha .... Opposite Party on 6 February, 2024 Author: Sashikanta Mishra Bench: Sashikanta Mishra In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack Ablapl No. 852 of 2024 Koteswar Patra@E. .... Petitioner Koteswar Patro@Epari Koteswar Patra Mr. J. Sahoo, Advocate -Versus - State of Odisha .... Opposite Party Additional Standing Counsel Coram: Justice Sashikanta Mishra Order_ 06.02.2024 Order No. 1. This matter is taken up through hybrid mode.",
    "facts": "3. The petitioner is apprehending arrest in connection with Paralakhemundi P.S. Case No. 358 of 2023 corresponding to G.R. Case No. 697 of 2023 pending in the court of learned S.D.J.M., Paralakhemundi for the alleged commission of offence under Sections 272/34/420/482/483/ of IPC read with Section 20 of the Cigarettes and other Tobacco Products Act and Sections 51/52/56/59/63 of Food Safety and Standards Act. 4. It is alleged that the petitioner was selling duplicate and misbranded tobacco products.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
